{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01JrTd2keEMFMo1r5CGAjAtn","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Reframe 策略（仍冲 EMNLP Main）：\n  (1) C2b 升级为 sole primary — per-axis confound structure 成为核心贡献。\n  Title → \"When Style Bias Hides in Plain Sight: Per-Axis Confound Decomposition for LLM Judge Auditing\"。\n  (2) Blindspot 降为 conditional finding — 仅对 moderate-effect axes（BT<75%）成立；\n  strong-effect axes 可被 fine-grained Likert 部分检测到。\n  Reframe 为 \"effect-size-dependent measurement sensitivity\"。\n  (3) Judge susceptibility 2/4 split → \"CSD as diagnostic tool reveals which architectures are susceptible\"。\n  50/50 比 3/4 更有 practical value（不是所有 judge 都有 bias，practitioners 需 per-judge 审计）。\n  (4) 预期 reviewer score 3.0-3.5，需强 rebuttal 冲 Findings。\n  Novelty 天花板降低（confound decomposition 单挑大梁），但 statistical methodology depth\n  + honest artifact framing + effect-size-dependent sensitivity 分析仍有足够学术价值。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n\n  - name: \"Multi-judge formality pairwise (Gemini-2.0-Flash)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-001\"\n    description: >\n      Gemini-2.0-Flash 作为第5个 judge 评估 100 对 formality counterfactual pairs。\n      Claude 已完成（negative control, BT 56.2%）。\n    expected_results:\n      gemini_n_pairs: 88\n      gemini_consistency_rate: 0.55\n      gemini_bt_p_formal: 0.551\n      gemini_bt_ci: [0.475, 0.627]\n      gemini_bt_p_value: 0.17\n      gemini_likert_ate: -0.031\n      gemini_likert_p: 0.76\n      gemini_likert_d: -0.025\n      gemini_likert_tie_rate: 0.70\n      gemini_gee_style_or: 1.31\n      gemini_gee_style_p: 0.46\n      gemini_gee_orig_or: 4.28\n      gemini_gee_orig_p: 0.0002\n      gemini_biased: false\n      total_biased_ratio: \"2/5 (GPT-4o + Qwen3-32B only)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Gemini-2.0-Flash 是 Google 轻量级模型，instruction-following 偏保守。\n      在 worst case 下 Gemini 与 Claude/Llama 一致：BT 55.1%（NS），\n      仅 originality OR 显著（4.28），style OR ≈ 1（1.31, NS）。\n      原因：Flash 模型在 RLHF 中对 style 维度的 reward shaping 较弱，\n      不会 systematically 偏好某种 style。GEE 中 originality confound\n      显著说明 Gemini 仍能检测到 rewriting artifact（偏好 LLM-polished text），\n      但不会将 style difference 转化为 quality preference。\n      Biased judges 比例降至 2/5，进一步削弱 \"widespread\" 叙事。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Cross-Judge Formality BT Summary\"\n        headers: [Judge, Architecture, BT, CI, p, Biased]\n        rows:\n          - [GPT-4o, \"Proprietary (OpenAI)\", \"63.0%\", \"[55.8, 70.3]\", \"<0.001\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [Qwen3-32B, \"Open (Alibaba)\", \"66.5%\", \"[58.5, 73.9]\", \"<0.0001\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [Claude Sonnet 4, \"Proprietary (Anthropic)\", \"56.2%\", \"[48.9, 63.6]\", \"0.091\", \"No (ctrl)\"]\n          - [Llama-3.3-70B, \"Open (Meta)\", \"52.0%\", \"[44.5, 59.8]\", \"0.55\", \"No\"]\n          - [Gemini-2.0-Flash, \"Proprietary (Google)\", \"55.1%\", \"[47.5, 62.7]\", \"0.17\", \"No\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Forest plot: 5 judges formality BT with 95% CI。GPT-4o/Qwen3-32B CI 不含 50%；Claude/Llama/Gemini CI 含 50%。清晰 2/5 split。\"\n    analysis: >\n      2/5 split 强化 \"CSD as per-judge diagnostic tool\" 定位。\n      No correlation with proprietary vs open → bias 不是 model accessibility artifact。\n\n  - name: \"Multi-benchmark formality pairwise (extended judges)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-002\"\n    description: >\n      扩展 CSD pipeline 到 AlpacaEval + MT-Bench，加入 Llama/Gemini judges。\n      GPT-4o 两个 benchmark 已完成；Qwen3-32B 数据已在 paper_framing 中。\n    expected_results:\n      # New cells: Llama + Gemini on AlpacaEval + MT-Bench\n      llama_alpacaeval_formality_bt: 0.535\n      llama_alpacaeval_formality_p: 0.42\n      llama_mtbench_formality_bt: 0.512\n      llama_mtbench_formality_p: 0.80\n      gemini_alpacaeval_formality_bt: 0.558\n      gemini_alpacaeval_formality_p: 0.16\n      gemini_mtbench_formality_bt: 0.542\n      gemini_mtbench_formality_p: 0.32\n      # Qwen3-32B (from paper_framing, already collected)\n      qwen32b_alpacaeval_bt: 0.657\n      qwen32b_mtbench_bt: 0.712\n      # Cross-benchmark consistency\n      biased_judges_consistent_across_benchmarks: true\n      unbiased_judges_consistent_across_benchmarks: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Cross-benchmark 结果呈现 judge-level consistency：GPT-4o 和 Qwen3-32B\n      在所有 3 个 benchmark 上均 significant（BT 63-73%），而 Llama（51-54%）\n      和 Gemini（54-56%）在所有 benchmark 上均 NS。\n      这实际是有价值的 finding：susceptibility 是 architecture-level 属性，\n      不是 benchmark-specific。Per-axis confound structure（GEE decomposition）\n      在 biased judges 上跨 benchmark 复制（Qwen3-32B AlpacaEval Style OR ≈ 4.5,\n      Orig OR ≈ 3.8），而 unbiased judges GEE Style OR ≈ 1.1-1.3（NS）。\n      Worst case 下 Llama/Gemini 的 cross-benchmark consistency 强化了\n      \"bias is architecture-dependent\" 的 empirical claim。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Cross-Benchmark × Cross-Judge Formality BT Matrix\"\n        headers: [Judge, LLMBar, AlpacaEval, MT-Bench, Consistent]\n        rows:\n          - [GPT-4o, \"63.0%***\", \"72.7%***\", \"69.2%***\", \"Biased ✓\"]\n          - [Qwen3-32B, \"66.5%***\", \"65.7%***\", \"71.2%***\", \"Biased ✓\"]\n          - [Llama-70B, \"52.0% ns\", \"53.5% ns\", \"51.2% ns\", \"Unbiased ✓\"]\n          - [Gemini-Flash, \"55.1% ns\", \"55.8% ns\", \"54.2% ns\", \"Unbiased ✓\"]\n          - [Claude (ctrl), \"56.2% ns\", \"—\", \"—\", \"Unbiased ✓\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Heatmap: judge × benchmark, color = |BT - 50%|。清晰的 row-level clustering（biased vs unbiased），非 column-level（non-benchmark-specific）。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Judge-level consistency 支撑 C3 reframe。在 worst case 下，\n      \"CSD diagnoses architecture-level susceptibility\" 比 \"all judges are biased\" 更精确、更有 practical value。\n\n  - name: \"Likert vs Pairwise sensitivity (incl. 100-point Likert ablation)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-003\"\n    description: >\n      Systematic sensitivity comparison：7-point Likert、100-point Likert、BT pairwise。\n      WORST CASE 核心实验：100-point Likert 检测到 verbosity bias 但不检测 formality。\n    expected_results:\n      # 100-point Likert — verbosity (Qwen3-32B × LLMBar)\n      likert_100pt_verbosity_n: 86\n      likert_100pt_verbosity_ate: 2.84\n      likert_100pt_verbosity_p: 0.008\n      likert_100pt_verbosity_d: 0.31\n      likert_100pt_verbosity_tie_rate: 0.09\n      likert_100pt_verbosity_mean_verbose: 68.2\n      likert_100pt_verbosity_mean_concise: 65.4\n      likert_100pt_verbosity_wilcoxon_p: 0.011\n      # 100-point Likert — formality (Qwen3-32B × LLMBar, n=355)\n      likert_100pt_formality_n: 355\n      likert_100pt_formality_ate: 0.48\n      likert_100pt_formality_p: 0.52\n      likert_100pt_formality_d: 0.04\n      likert_100pt_formality_tie_rate: 0.04\n      likert_100pt_formality_mean_formal: 66.9\n      likert_100pt_formality_mean_casual: 66.4\n      # 100-point Likert — verbosity (GPT-4o × LLMBar)\n      likert_100pt_gpt4o_verbosity_n: 86\n      likert_100pt_gpt4o_verbosity_d: 0.27\n      likert_100pt_gpt4o_verbosity_p: 0.018\n      # 100-point Likert — formality (GPT-4o × LLMBar)\n      likert_100pt_gpt4o_formality_d: 0.06\n      likert_100pt_gpt4o_formality_p: 0.38\n      # Attenuation ratios\n      attenuation_7pt_formality: \">17×\"\n      attenuation_7pt_verbosity: \">10×\"\n      attenuation_100pt_formality: \"~17×\"\n      attenuation_100pt_verbosity: \"~4×\"\n      # Threshold\n      blindspot_threshold_bt_approx: 0.75\n      note: \"Axes with BT > ~75% partially detectable by 100-point Likert; BT 60-70% universally blind\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      100-point Likert 在 verbosity 上检测到 d=0.31（p=0.008），原因：\n      (1) Verbosity BT = 77.3% 是所有 axis 中最强的效应，对应 d_BT_equiv ≈ 1.2；\n      (2) 100-point scale 将 tie rate 从 7-point 的 58% 降至 9%，\n      释放了大量被 ceiling/floor compression 锁死的 variance；\n      (3) d=0.31 虽然 significant 但仍远低于 BT equivalent（ratio 4×），\n      说明 Likert 仍 severely attenuates 即使使用 fine-grained scale。\n      \n      Formality 100-point Likert 仍 NS（d=0.04, p=0.52），原因：\n      (1) Formality BT = 66.5% 是 moderate effect，d_BT_equiv ≈ 0.7；\n      (2) 即使 tie rate 降至 4%，underlying effect 太弱（d=0.04），\n      即使在 n=355 上也无法达到显著性（power at d=0.04 n=355 α=0.05 ≈ 8%）；\n      (3) Formality 的 GEE 显示 Style + Orig 均显著 → conditional effect，\n      在绝对评分中 style 和 originality 的相反方向效应可能互相抵消。\n      \n      核心含义：Blindspot 是 effect-size-dependent。Strong effects（BT>75%）\n      可被 fine-grained Likert 部分检测（但仍严重衰减 4×），\n      moderate effects（BT 60-70%）在任何 Likert scale 上都不可见。\n      这比 \"Likert always misses\" 更 nuanced，学术价值更高。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Measurement Mode × Scale × Axis Sensitivity Matrix (Qwen3-32B × LLMBar)\"\n        headers: [Method, Formality d, Formality p, Verbosity d, Verbosity p, Detects]\n        rows:\n          - [\"7-pt Likert ATE\", \"0.012\", \"0.908\", \"-0.146\", \"0.179\", \"Neither\"]\n          - [\"7-pt Ordinal LR\", \"-0.079\", \"0.769\", \"0.159\", \"0.575\", \"Neither\"]\n          - [\"7-pt Mann-Whitney\", \"—\", \"0.905\", \"—\", \"0.578\", \"Neither\"]\n          - [\"7-pt Binarized χ²\", \"—\", \"0.296\", \"—\", \"0.213\", \"Neither\"]\n          - [\"7-pt Cohen's d\", \"0.012\", \">0.2\", \"0.036\", \">0.2\", \"Neither\"]\n          - [\"7-pt Likert (all 6)\", \"0/6 sig\", \"—\", \"0/6 sig\", \"—\", \"0/12\"]\n          - [\"100-pt Likert ATE\", \"0.04\", \"0.52\", \"0.31\", \"0.008\", \"Verbosity only\"]\n          - [\"BT pairwise\", \"66.5%\", \"<0.0001\", \"77.3%\", \"<0.0001\", \"Both\"]\n      - title: \"Attenuation Ratio by Scale × Axis\"\n        headers: [Scale, Formality ratio, Verbosity ratio, Interpretation]\n        rows:\n          - [\"7-point\", \">17×\", \">10×\", \"Universal blindspot\"]\n          - [\"100-point\", \"~17×\", \"~4×\", \"Partial rescue for strong effects only\"]\n          - [\"Implication\", \"Scale irrelevant\", \"Scale helps but still 4× loss\", \"Effect-size-dependent\"]\n      - title: \"100-point Likert Detection Threshold Analysis\"\n        headers: [Axis, BT, 7-pt d, 100-pt d, 100-pt p, Detected]\n        rows:\n          - [Register, \"55.3%\", \"0.069\", \"0.05\", \"0.65\", \"No\"]\n          - [Formality, \"66.5%\", \"0.012\", \"0.04\", \"0.52\", \"No\"]\n          - [Verbosity, \"77.3%\", \"-0.146\", \"0.31\", \"0.008\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [Threshold, \"~75%\", \"—\", \"~0.25\", \"<0.05\", \"BT > 75%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter: x = BT effect size (%), y = Likert Cohen's d, 按 scale type 分色（7-pt grey, 100-pt blue）。7-point 全在 d≈0 水平线；100-point formality/register 仍在 0 附近，verbosity 跳至 d=0.31。BT reference diagonal 显示 massive gap。Annotated threshold at BT≈75%。\"\n      - \"Bar chart: tie rate comparison。7-pt verbosity 58% → 100-pt verbosity 9%；7-pt formality 73% → 100-pt formality 4%。Granularity 释放 variance 但不足以检测 moderate effects。\"\n      - \"Power curve: d=0.04（formality 100-pt）vs d=0.31（verbosity 100-pt）at various n。d=0.04 需 n>4000 才能达 80% power；d=0.31 在 n=86 达 ~75% power。\"\n    analysis: >\n      100-point Likert verbosity significant 是 worst case 的 defining challenge。\n      Reframe 策略：(1) \"effect-size-dependent measurement sensitivity\" 比 \"Likert always fails\" 更 nuanced；\n      (2) 即使 100-pt 检测到 verbosity，attenuation ratio 仍 4× — pairwise 仍远优于 Likert；\n      (3) Formality（medium effect）在 n=355 × 100-point 仍 NS → 实际场景中多数 bias 不可被 Likert 检测；\n      (4) Per-axis confound structure（C2b）解释了为什么不同 axis 有不同检测阈值：\n      verbosity 是 pure style（无 originality confound 抵消），formality 是 conditional\n      （style + originality 在 absolute scoring 中方向可能相反，互相抵消）。\n\n  - name: \"Pairwise RATE control (all judge × benchmark)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-005\"\n    description: >\n      原始 vs double-rewrite placebo 扩展到所有 judge × benchmark combinations。\n      GPT-4o 和 Qwen3-32B × LLMBar 已完成。\n    expected_results:\n      # Already done (from registry)\n      qwen32b_lmbar_formality_p_orig: 0.377\n      qwen32b_lmbar_verbosity_p_orig: 0.082\n      gpt4o_lmbar_formality_p_orig: 0.418\n      gpt4o_lmbar_verbosity_p_orig: 0.167\n      # New: Llama × LLMBar\n      llama_lmbar_formality_p_orig: 0.425\n      llama_lmbar_formality_p: 0.065\n      llama_lmbar_verbosity_p_orig: 0.215\n      llama_lmbar_verbosity_p: \"<0.0001\"\n      # New: Gemini × LLMBar\n      gemini_lmbar_formality_p_orig: 0.438\n      gemini_lmbar_formality_p: 0.11\n      # New: GPT-4o × AlpacaEval\n      gpt4o_alpacaeval_formality_p_orig: 0.395\n      gpt4o_alpacaeval_formality_p: 0.008\n      # Cross-judge artifact\n      artifact_direction: \"ALL judges prefer DR over original (universal)\"\n      artifact_magnitude_order: \"Verbosity >> Formality across all judges\"\n      artifact_vs_style_independence: \"Llama has artifact (P(orig)=42-22%) but NO style bias → artifact ≠ style bias\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Rewriting artifact 是 universal 现象——所有 judge 均偏好 LLM-polished (DR) text，\n      与 judge 是否展现 style bias 无关。\n      关键 worst-case 证据：Llama 有 artifact（formality P(orig)=42.5%, verbosity P(orig)=21.5%）\n      但 style bias BT 均 NS（52-54%）。\n      这证明 (1) artifact 和 style bias 是独立维度；\n      (2) GEE decomposition 正确分离了二者（verbosity Orig OR NS = style clean）；\n      (3) unbiased judges 的 artifact 不会 escalate 为 style bias。\n      AlpacaEval 的 artifact 略强于 LLMBar（P(orig)=39.5% vs 41.8%），\n      可能因 AlpacaEval instructions 更 open-ended，rewriting polishing 更明显。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Placebo P(original) Across Judges × Benchmarks\"\n        headers: [Judge, LLMBar Form, LLMBar Verb, AlpacaEval Form, Style biased?]\n        rows:\n          - [GPT-4o, \"0.418*\", \"0.167***\", \"0.395**\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [Qwen3-32B, \"0.377***\", \"0.082***\", \"—\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [Llama-70B, \"0.425 ns\", \"0.215***\", \"—\", \"No\"]\n          - [Gemini-Flash, \"0.438 ns\", \"—\", \"—\", \"No\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter: x = placebo P(original), y = style BT。Biased judges (GPT-4o, Qwen3-32B) 在右上；Llama 在左下（low P(orig) but low BT）。No correlation → artifact ≠ style bias。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Llama 有 artifact 但无 bias 是 worst case 下的 silver lining。\n      它直接反驳 \"pairwise format creates bias from artifact\" 假说：\n      如果 artifact sufficient for bias，Llama 应该也 biased — 但它不是。\n\n  - name: \"Scaled replication (n=400, Qwen3-32B formality)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-006\"\n    description: >\n      n=100 → n=400 scaled replication。已在 registry 中完成（exp-006）。\n      展示 worst case 下此数据如何被引用。\n    expected_results:\n      n_total: 400\n      nli_pass: 355\n      nli_rate: 0.888\n      bt_p_formal: 0.675\n      bt_ci: [0.637, 0.713]\n      bt_ci_width_pp: 7.6\n      bt_p_value: 0.0001\n      likert_7pt_ate: -0.059\n      likert_7pt_p: 0.60\n      likert_7pt_d: -0.025\n      likert_7pt_tie_rate: 0.434\n      gee_style_or: 2.15\n      gee_style_ci: [1.46, 3.16]\n      gee_orig_or: 4.99\n      gee_orig_ci: [3.40, 7.34]\n      vs_n100_bt_delta_pp: \"+1.0\"\n      vs_n100_ci_narrowing: \"2× (15.4pp → 7.6pp)\"\n      bootstrap_attenuation_d_median: -0.017\n      bootstrap_attenuation_flat: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      已完成实验，结果与 worst case 完全一致。n=355 确认：\n      (1) BT 67.5% 稳定（vs n=100 的 66.5%，Δ=+1.0pp within CI）；\n      (2) 7-point Likert d=-0.025 在 n=355 仍 NS → 不是 power 问题；\n      (3) Bootstrap attenuation curve 是 smoking gun：d_median flat at -0.017\n      across n=50→355，CI 始终含 0 → definitive measurement attenuation 证据；\n      (4) GEE Style OR=2.15（moderate）确认 formality 是 conditional effect\n      （vs verbosity Style OR=13.1 pure effect）。\n      在 worst case 下，formality Blindspot 在 7-point 和 100-point Likert 上均成立，\n      是论文最 robust 的单一 evidence piece。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Scaled Replication: n=100 vs n=355 Comparison\"\n        headers: [Metric, \"n=100\", \"n=355\", Delta]\n        rows:\n          - [BT, \"66.5%\", \"67.5%\", \"+1.0pp\"]\n          - [BT CI width, \"15.4pp\", \"7.6pp\", \"2× narrower\"]\n          - [Likert d, \"0.012\", \"-0.025\", \"~0 (stable)\"]\n          - [GEE Style OR, \"4.20\", \"2.15\", \"Regression to true effect\"]\n          - [GEE Orig OR, \"4.70\", \"4.99\", \"Stable\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bootstrap attenuation curve（已生成）：d_median vs n (50→355)，flat at -0.017。已在 registry 中。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Formality × Qwen3-32B (n=355) 是论文的 anchor result，worst case 不改变此数据。\n      与 100-point Likert formality NS（exp-003）形成 converging evidence：\n      无论 7-point 还是 100-point，无论 n=100 还是 n=355，\n      formality Likert Blindspot 都成立。\n\n  - name: \"Non-Qwen rewriter control (Llama-3.1-70B rewriter)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-009\"\n    description: >\n      Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct 作为 alternative rewriter，排除 Qwen-family artifact。\n      与已完成的 GPT-4o rewriter (64.4%) 和 Qwen3-32B rewriter (66.5%) 对比。\n    expected_results:\n      llama_rewriter_n_generated: 100\n      llama_rewriter_nli_pass: 87\n      llama_rewriter_nli_rate: 0.87\n      llama_rewriter_nli_mean: 0.882\n      llama_rewriter_bt_formality: 0.641\n      llama_rewriter_bt_ci: [0.558, 0.724]\n      llama_rewriter_bt_p: 0.0008\n      llama_rewriter_likert_d: -0.035\n      llama_rewriter_likert_p: 0.71\n      llama_rewriter_gee_style_or: 3.65\n      llama_rewriter_gee_style_p: 0.001\n      llama_rewriter_gee_orig_or: 5.80\n      llama_rewriter_gee_orig_p: 0.0001\n      three_rewriter_range_pp: 2.4\n      three_rewriter_ci_overlap: true\n      rewriter_independence_confirmed: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      三个独立 rewriter family（Qwen3-32B 66.5%, GPT-4o 64.4%, Llama-70B 64.1%）\n      产生的 BT 在 2.4pp 范围内，所有 CI 重叠且均排除 50%。\n      NLI pass rate 三者类似（88%/90%/87%），说明 counterfactual quality 与 rewriter 无关。\n      Llama rewriter 的 GEE pattern 也复制：Style + Orig 均显著（conditional effect）。\n      Worst case 下此实验不受影响——rewriter independence 是 method validation，\n      与 judge-level results（Llama-as-judge 无 bias）完全正交。\n      三个 rewriter 的 convergence 证明 CSD 不是 Qwen3-32B 特定 artifact。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Three-Rewriter Formality BT Comparison (Qwen3-32B judge × LLMBar)\"\n        headers: [Rewriter, NLI pass, BT, CI, p, Δ vs Qwen-rewriter]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen3-32B, \"88%\", \"66.5%\", \"[58.5, 73.9]\", \"<0.0001\", \"baseline\"]\n          - [GPT-4o, \"90%\", \"64.4%\", \"[56.1, 72.8]\", \"0.0006\", \"-2.1pp\"]\n          - [Llama-3.1-70B, \"87%\", \"64.1%\", \"[55.8, 72.4]\", \"0.0008\", \"-2.4pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Forest plot: 3 rewriters BT with CI。三者 CI 重叠且不含 50%。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Rewriter independence 在 worst case 下是 net positive：\n      证明 detected style bias 不依赖特定 rewriter model，是 CSD 方法 robustness 的关键 validation。\n\n  - name: \"GPT-4o verbosity + register Likert scoring\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-020\"\n    description: >\n      GPT-4o Likert ATE 分析。Pairwise 和 GEE 已完成（registry）。\n      Verbosity Likert ATE 是 Blindspot evidence matrix 的关键缺失格。\n    expected_results:\n      # Verbosity (pairwise/GEE from registry; Likert from registry)\n      gpt4o_verbosity_bt: 0.760\n      gpt4o_verbosity_likert_ate: 0.116\n      gpt4o_verbosity_likert_p: 0.403\n      gpt4o_verbosity_likert_d: 0.078\n      gpt4o_verbosity_likert_tie_rate: 0.581\n      gpt4o_verbosity_gee_style_or: 10.97\n      gpt4o_verbosity_gee_orig_or: 0.44\n      gpt4o_verbosity_blindspot: true\n      # Register (from registry)\n      gpt4o_register_bt: 0.570\n      gpt4o_register_likert_ate: 0.0\n      gpt4o_register_likert_p: 0.785\n      gpt4o_register_likert_d: 0.0\n      gpt4o_register_gee_style_or: 1.88\n      gpt4o_register_gee_orig_or: 2.21\n      gpt4o_register_blindspot: true\n      # 100-point Likert extension (worst case)\n      gpt4o_100pt_verbosity_d: 0.27\n      gpt4o_100pt_verbosity_p: 0.018\n      gpt4o_100pt_formality_d: 0.06\n      gpt4o_100pt_formality_p: 0.38\n    result_rationale: >\n      GPT-4o 在所有 3 个 axis 上均展现 7-point Likert Blindspot\n      （BT significant, Likert NS）。Verbosity ATE=0.116 (p=0.40) 确认\n      BT 76.0% 的 bias 被 Likert 完全遗漏。\n      在 worst case 下，100-point Likert 对 GPT-4o verbosity 也检测到 d=0.27（p=0.018），\n      与 Qwen3-32B pattern 一致（both BT >75%, both 100-pt detectable）。\n      GPT-4o formality 100-point d=0.06（NS），同样与 Qwen3-32B 一致。\n      这确认了 effect-size threshold 是 cross-judge 的，不是 judge-specific 的。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"GPT-4o Full Blindspot Matrix\"\n        headers: [Axis, BT, BT p, 7-pt d, 7-pt p, 100-pt d, 100-pt p, Blindspot]\n        rows:\n          - [Formality, \"63.0%\", \"<0.001\", \"-0.069\", \"0.332\", \"0.06\", \"0.38\", \"Yes (all scales)\"]\n          - [Verbosity, \"76.0%\", \"0.0001\", \"0.078\", \"0.403\", \"0.27\", \"0.018\", \"7-pt only\"]\n          - [Register, \"57.0%\", \"0.04\", \"0.0\", \"0.785\", \"—\", \"—\", \"Yes (all scales)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"GPT-4o 3-axis panel: BT vs 7-pt Likert vs 100-pt Likert bar chart。Verbosity 100-pt bar crosses significance threshold；其余均 NS。\"\n    analysis: >\n      GPT-4o 100-point verbosity significant 进一步确认 threshold 是 ~BT>75%。\n      两个 biased judges（GPT-4o + Qwen3-32B）均展现相同 threshold pattern → \n      effect-size-dependent sensitivity 是 robust cross-judge finding。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct third target judge\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-021\"\n    description: >\n      Llama-3.3-70B as third target judge：formality + verbosity on LLMBar。\n      WORST CASE DEFINING EXPERIMENT：Llama 两轴均 NS，类似 Claude。\n    expected_results:\n      # Formality\n      llama_formality_n_pairs: 88\n      llama_formality_n_comparisons: 176\n      llama_formality_consistency_rate: 0.57\n      llama_formality_bt_p_formal: 0.520\n      llama_formality_bt_ci: [0.445, 0.598]\n      llama_formality_bt_p_value: 0.55\n      llama_formality_likert_ate: -0.023\n      llama_formality_likert_p: 0.82\n      llama_formality_likert_d: -0.018\n      llama_formality_likert_tie_rate: 0.69\n      llama_formality_gee_style_or: 1.12\n      llama_formality_gee_style_ci: [0.55, 2.28]\n      llama_formality_gee_style_p: 0.75\n      llama_formality_gee_orig_or: 5.45\n      llama_formality_gee_orig_ci: [2.56, 11.60]\n      llama_formality_gee_orig_p: 0.0001\n      llama_formality_dir_f2c_win: 0.548\n      llama_formality_dir_f2c_p: 0.65\n      llama_formality_dir_c2f_win: 0.488\n      llama_formality_dir_c2f_p: 0.92\n      # Verbosity\n      llama_verbosity_n_pairs: 86\n      llama_verbosity_n_comparisons: 172\n      llama_verbosity_consistency_rate: 0.55\n      llama_verbosity_bt_p_verbose: 0.538\n      llama_verbosity_bt_ci: [0.462, 0.614]\n      llama_verbosity_bt_p_value: 0.35\n      llama_verbosity_likert_ate: 0.035\n      llama_verbosity_likert_p: 0.76\n      llama_verbosity_likert_d: 0.028\n      llama_verbosity_likert_tie_rate: 0.67\n      llama_verbosity_gee_style_or: 1.28\n      llama_verbosity_gee_style_ci: [0.58, 2.82]\n      llama_verbosity_gee_style_p: 0.52\n      llama_verbosity_gee_orig_or: 0.82\n      llama_verbosity_gee_orig_ci: [0.38, 1.78]\n      llama_verbosity_gee_orig_p: 0.58\n      llama_verbosity_dir_v2c_win: 0.52\n      llama_verbosity_dir_v2c_p: 0.78\n      llama_verbosity_dir_c2v_win: 0.55\n      llama_verbosity_dir_c2v_p: 0.48\n      # TOST equivalence\n      llama_tost_formality_margin: 0.15\n      llama_tost_formality_p_upper: 0.001\n      llama_tost_formality_confirmed: true\n      llama_tost_formality_90ci: [0.455, 0.585]\n      llama_tost_verbosity_margin: 0.15\n      llama_tost_verbosity_p_upper: 0.003\n      llama_tost_verbosity_confirmed: true\n      llama_tost_verbosity_90ci: [0.473, 0.603]\n      # 7-method sensitivity (verbosity)\n      llama_verbosity_7method_all_ns: true\n      llama_verbosity_bt_also_ns: true\n      # Summary\n      llama_biased: false\n      llama_pattern: \"Matches Claude — no style sensitivity on either axis\"\n      n_biased_target_judges: 2\n      n_total_judges: 4\n      biased_ratio: \"2/4 (GPT-4o + Qwen3-32B)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Llama-3.3-70B 两轴均 NS 是 worst case 的核心事件。\n\n      Formality：BT 52.0%（CI 含 50%，p=0.55），GEE Style OR=1.12（NS）。\n      与 Claude（BT 56.2%，Style OR=1.47）pattern 高度一致——两者都仅检测到\n      originality confound（Orig OR 5.45/6.66）但无 style effect。\n      这说明 Meta 和 Anthropic 的 alignment 流程都产生了 style-neutral 的 judge behavior。\n      \n      Verbosity：BT 53.8%（p=0.35），GEE Style OR=1.28（NS），Orig OR=0.82（NS）。\n      与 Claude（BT 54.1%，Style OR=1.52）一致。值得注意的是 Llama verbosity \n      Orig OR=0.82（NS），而 Claude Orig OR=0.80（NS），两者在 verbosity 上\n      都不展现 originality confound——与 biased judges（GPT-4o/Qwen3-32B）的\n      Orig OR=0.44-0.49 方向一致但 magnitude 不同。\n      \n      TOST equivalence 在 Δ=0.15 下两轴均通过（formality p=0.001, verbosity p=0.003），\n      确认 null 是 genuine absence 而非 underpowered。注意：Claude 在 Δ=0.10 下\n      TOST 失败（formality p=0.155），但 Llama point estimates 更接近 50%，\n      即使在 Δ=0.10 下也可能通过（formality p≈0.05, borderline）。\n      \n      对论文影响：\n      (1) \"3 independent architectures confirm bias\" → 变为 \"CSD discriminates: 2/4 biased, 2/4 unbiased\"\n      (2) MF1 Layer 5 不再是 anti-amplification 证据，但可 reframe 为\n      \"same pairwise format, same counterfactuals, no bias → format doesn't create bias\"\n      (3) 50/50 split 实际更有 practical value：不是所有 judge 都 biased，\n      practitioners 需要 CSD 进行 per-judge 审计来确定哪些 judge 可信。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Llama-70B vs Claude Sonnet 4 (Negative Controls)\"\n        headers: [Metric, Llama Form, Llama Verb, Claude Form, Claude Verb]\n        rows:\n          - [BT, \"52.0%\", \"53.8%\", \"56.2%\", \"54.1%\"]\n          - [BT p, \"0.55\", \"0.35\", \"0.091\", \"0.284\"]\n          - [BT CI, \"[44.5, 59.8]\", \"[46.2, 61.4]\", \"[48.9, 63.6]\", \"[45.9, 61.6]\"]\n          - [Likert d, \"-0.018\", \"0.028\", \"-0.021\", \"-0.039\"]\n          - [GEE Style OR, \"1.12 ns\", \"1.28 ns\", \"1.47 ns\", \"1.52 ns\"]\n          - [GEE Orig OR, \"5.45***\", \"0.82 ns\", \"6.66***\", \"0.80 ns\"]\n          - [TOST Δ=0.15, \"✓ p=.001\", \"✓ p=.003\", \"✓ p=.009\", \"✓ p=.016\"]\n      - title: \"Judge Susceptibility Matrix (Worst Case Final)\"\n        headers: [Judge, Formality BT, Verbosity BT, Style OR range, Biased]\n        rows:\n          - [GPT-4o, \"63.0%***\", \"76.0%***\", \"2.21–10.97\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [Qwen3-32B, \"66.5%***\", \"77.3%***\", \"4.20–13.10\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [Llama-70B, \"52.0% ns\", \"53.8% ns\", \"1.12–1.28\", \"No\"]\n          - [Claude (ctrl), \"56.2% ns\", \"54.1% ns\", \"1.47–1.52\", \"No\"]\n      - title: \"Llama GEE Decomposition (Per-Axis)\"\n        headers: [Axis, Style OR, Style p, Orig OR, Orig p, Regime]\n        rows:\n          - [Formality, \"1.12\", \"0.75\", \"5.45\", \"<0.0001\", \"Originality-only\"]\n          - [Verbosity, \"1.28\", \"0.52\", \"0.82\", \"0.58\", \"Null (no effect)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"2×2 Judge susceptibility heatmap：行 = judge，列 = axis。Color = BT deviation from 50%。GPT-4o/Qwen3-32B 行全红（13-27pp deviation）；Llama/Claude 行全灰（2-6pp deviation）。\"\n      - \"Forest plot: 4 judges × 2 axes (8 entries) BT with CI。清晰的 bimodal distribution：4 个 CI 不含 50%（biased），4 个 CI 含 50%（unbiased）。\"\n      - \"GEE Style OR forest plot: 4 judges × 2 axes。GPT-4o/Qwen3-32B OR 远离 1（2.2-13.1）；Llama/Claude OR 接近 1（1.1-1.5），所有 CI 含 1。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Llama 无 bias 将论文从 \"most judges are biased\" reframe 为\n      \"some architectures are susceptible, CSD identifies which\"。\n      2/4 split 的 practical implication：\n      在 alignment pipeline 中，使用 Llama/Claude 作为 judge 不受 style bias 影响，\n      而 GPT-4o/Qwen3-32B 需要 CSD 审计和 per-axis decomposition 来解读结果。\n      这比 \"all judges are biased, avoid Likert\" 更 actionable。\n\n  - name: \"Double-rewrite placebo BT (anti-amplification)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-022\"\n    description: >\n      Original vs double-rewrite pairwise comparison。已在 registry 完成（GPT-4o + Qwen3-32B）。\n      Worst case 增加 Llama placebo。\n    expected_results:\n      # Registry data (unchanged)\n      qwen32b_formality_p_orig: 0.377\n      qwen32b_formality_p: 0.0006\n      qwen32b_verbosity_p_orig: 0.082\n      qwen32b_verbosity_p: 0.0\n      gpt4o_formality_p_orig: 0.418\n      gpt4o_formality_p: 0.037\n      gpt4o_verbosity_p_orig: 0.167\n      gpt4o_verbosity_p: 0.0\n      # Worst case: Llama placebo\n      llama_formality_p_orig: 0.428\n      llama_formality_p: 0.07\n      llama_verbosity_p_orig: 0.230\n      llama_verbosity_p: 0.0001\n      # Key insight\n      artifact_present_in_all: true\n      style_bias_present_only_in_gpt4o_qwen32b: true\n      artifact_style_independence: \"Llama has artifact but no style bias → artifact ≠ sufficient for style bias\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      所有 judge（包括 unbiased 的 Llama）都偏好 DR over original：\n      Llama formality P(orig)=42.8%（borderline, p=0.07），verbosity P(orig)=23.0%（p<0.0001）。\n      但 Llama style bias BT = 52-54%（NS）。\n      这是 worst case 下最强的 anti-amplification 证据之一：\n      如果 pairwise format + rewriting artifact sufficient for style bias detection，\n      Llama 应该也展现 style bias——但它没有。\n      推论：style bias 是 judge architecture 的内在属性，不是 pairwise format 的 artifact。\n      GEE decomposition 正确分离了 artifact（Orig OR）和 style（Style OR）。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Placebo vs Style Bias: Independence Evidence\"\n        headers: [Judge, Form P(orig), Verb P(orig), Form style BT, Verb style BT, Conclusion]\n        rows:\n          - [GPT-4o, \"41.8%*\", \"16.7%***\", \"63.0%***\", \"76.0%***\", \"Artifact + Bias\"]\n          - [Qwen3-32B, \"37.7%***\", \"8.2%***\", \"66.5%***\", \"77.3%***\", \"Artifact + Bias\"]\n          - [Llama-70B, \"42.8% ns\", \"23.0%***\", \"52.0% ns\", \"53.8% ns\", \"Artifact only, NO Bias\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter: x = artifact magnitude (1 - P(orig)), y = style BT。Llama 在右下象限（strong artifact, no bias）→ 反驳 artifact→bias 因果链。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Llama 的 \"artifact without bias\" pattern 是 worst case 下\n      最有力的 detection-not-amplification 论证。\n      MF1 defense 从 5 层减为 4 层，但这 1 个 observation 的说服力不弱于原本的 Layer 5。\n\n  - name: \"NLI gate ablation (NLI-pass vs NLI-fail BT)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-023\"\n    description: >\n      BT on NLI-pass vs NLI-fail 子集。已在 registry 完成（nli_gate_ablation）。\n      Worst case 增加 Llama NLI ablation。\n    expected_results:\n      # Registry data (unchanged)\n      qwen_formality_nli_pass_bt: 0.665\n      qwen_formality_nli_fail_bt: 0.417\n      qwen_formality_nli_fail_note: \"REVERSED — prefer casual\"\n      qwen_verbosity_nli_pass_bt: 0.773\n      qwen_verbosity_nli_fail_bt: 0.750\n      qwen_verbosity_nli_fail_note: \"Stable — too strong for gate to affect\"\n      # Worst case: Llama NLI ablation\n      llama_formality_nli_pass_bt: 0.520\n      llama_formality_nli_fail_bt: 0.46\n      llama_formality_nli_fail_n: 12\n      llama_verbosity_nli_pass_bt: 0.538\n      llama_verbosity_nli_fail_bt: 0.50\n      llama_verbosity_nli_fail_n: 14\n    result_rationale: >\n      NLI ablation 是 MF1 Layer 1，在 worst case 下保持完整。\n      Qwen3-32B formality NLI-fail BT 41.7%（反转偏好 casual）是核心证据：\n      如果 pairwise 放大 bias，移除 NLI gate 应进一步放大——但相反，它反转了。\n      说明 NLI gate cleans content noise，不是 amplifies style signal。\n      \n      Llama NLI ablation（worst case extension）：两轴 NLI-fail BT 接近 50%\n      （formality 46%, verbosity 50%），与 overall null result 一致。\n      Llama 在 NLI-pass 和 NLI-fail 上都不展现 style sensitivity，\n      进一步确认 Llama 是 genuinely style-neutral judge。\n      NLI-fail n 小（12-14），结果仅作为 bounds 报告。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"NLI Ablation: Pass vs Fail BT\"\n        headers: [Judge, Axis, NLI-pass BT, NLI-fail BT, n_fail, Interpretation]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen3-32B, Formality, \"66.5%***\", \"41.7% ns\", 12, \"Reversal → gate cleans\"]\n          - [Qwen3-32B, Verbosity, \"77.3%***\", \"75.0%**\", 14, \"Too strong for gate\"]\n          - [Llama-70B, Formality, \"52.0% ns\", \"46% ns\", 12, \"No sensitivity either way\"]\n          - [Llama-70B, Verbosity, \"53.8% ns\", \"50% ns\", 14, \"No sensitivity either way\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Paired bar chart: NLI-pass vs NLI-fail per judge × axis。Qwen3-32B formality 反转是 visual highlight。Llama 两组均接近 50%。\"\n    analysis: >\n      MF1 Layer 1 在 worst case 下保持。NLI ablation reversal 仍是\n      最强 anti-amplification 单一 evidence。\n      Llama 的 flat response（pass ≈ fail ≈ 50%）是 complementary evidence。\n\n  - name: \"Cross-axis gradient formalization\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-024\"\n    description: >\n      NLI rejection rate vs BT for 3 axes。已在 registry 完成（cross_axis_gradient）。\n      Qualitative argument，3 points only。\n    expected_results:\n      register_nli_rejection: 0.06\n      register_bt_qwen: 0.553\n      register_gee_style_or: 1.91\n      formality_nli_rejection: 0.12\n      formality_bt_qwen: 0.665\n      formality_gee_style_or: 4.20\n      verbosity_nli_rejection: 0.14\n      verbosity_bt_qwen: 0.773\n      verbosity_gee_style_or: 13.10\n      correlation_direction: positive\n      n_data_points: 3\n      statistical_test: \"N/A — qualitative, 3 points insufficient for regression\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Cross-axis gradient 已完成。NLI rejection rate（manipulation invasiveness proxy）\n      与 BT 和 GEE Style OR 正相关：\n      Register（6% rejection, BT 55%, OR 1.9）< Formality（12%, 67%, 4.2）< Verbosity（14%, 77%, 13.1）。\n      \n      Anti-amplification 论证：如果 pairwise 统一放大 bias，所有 axis 应有相似 BT\n      （manipulation 程度差异不应影响 amplification）。但 per-axis variation 大（55-77%），\n      且与 manipulation invasiveness 正相关 → 检测到的是真实 bias，不是 format artifact。\n      \n      局限：仅 3 个数据点，不能做 statistical test。在 worst case 下降为 §5.2\n      discussion 中的 qualitative supporting argument（2-3 句话）。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Cross-Axis Gradient (Qwen3-32B × LLMBar)\"\n        headers: [Axis, NLI reject%, BT, GEE Style OR, 100-pt Likert d]\n        rows:\n          - [Register, \"6%\", \"55.3%\", \"1.91\", \"~0.05 ns\"]\n          - [Formality, \"12%\", \"66.5%\", \"4.20\", \"0.04 ns\"]\n          - [Verbosity, \"14%\", \"77.3%\", \"13.10\", \"0.31*\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Three-point scatter: x = NLI rejection rate, y = BT (left panel) / GEE Style OR (right panel)。Positive trend。Labeled points。\"\n    analysis: >\n      MF1 Layer 2 的 qualitative component。在 worst case 下，\n      cross-axis gradient 与 100-point Likert threshold 形成 converging evidence：\n      manipulation invasiveness → BT effect size → Likert detectability 的梯度一致，\n      支持 \"detection\" 而非 \"amplification\" interpretation。\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":34163,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":34163},"output_tokens":10,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d95a5f3b-8263-4a89-8f8c-68eaf58d3698","uuid":"0056346a-99d1-482d-a2d8-bb0bf75fdc5c"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":696948,"duration_api_ms":698604,"num_turns":1,"result":"```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Reframe 策略（仍冲 EMNLP Main）：\n  (1) C2b 升级为 sole primary — per-axis confound structure 成为核心贡献。\n  Title → \"When Style Bias Hides in Plain Sight: Per-Axis Confound Decomposition for LLM Judge Auditing\"。\n  (2) Blindspot 降为 conditional finding — 仅对 moderate-effect axes（BT<75%）成立；\n  strong-effect axes 可被 fine-grained Likert 部分检测到。\n  Reframe 为 \"effect-size-dependent measurement sensitivity\"。\n  (3) Judge susceptibility 2/4 split → \"CSD as diagnostic tool reveals which architectures are susceptible\"。\n  50/50 比 3/4 更有 practical value（不是所有 judge 都有 bias，practitioners 需 per-judge 审计）。\n  (4) 预期 reviewer score 3.0-3.5，需强 rebuttal 冲 Findings。\n  Novelty 天花板降低（confound decomposition 单挑大梁），但 statistical methodology depth\n  + honest artifact framing + effect-size-dependent sensitivity 分析仍有足够学术价值。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n\n  - name: \"Multi-judge formality pairwise (Gemini-2.0-Flash)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-001\"\n    description: >\n      Gemini-2.0-Flash 作为第5个 judge 评估 100 对 formality counterfactual pairs。\n      Claude 已完成（negative control, BT 56.2%）。\n    expected_results:\n      gemini_n_pairs: 88\n      gemini_consistency_rate: 0.55\n      gemini_bt_p_formal: 0.551\n      gemini_bt_ci: [0.475, 0.627]\n      gemini_bt_p_value: 0.17\n      gemini_likert_ate: -0.031\n      gemini_likert_p: 0.76\n      gemini_likert_d: -0.025\n      gemini_likert_tie_rate: 0.70\n      gemini_gee_style_or: 1.31\n      gemini_gee_style_p: 0.46\n      gemini_gee_orig_or: 4.28\n      gemini_gee_orig_p: 0.0002\n      gemini_biased: false\n      total_biased_ratio: \"2/5 (GPT-4o + Qwen3-32B only)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Gemini-2.0-Flash 是 Google 轻量级模型，instruction-following 偏保守。\n      在 worst case 下 Gemini 与 Claude/Llama 一致：BT 55.1%（NS），\n      仅 originality OR 显著（4.28），style OR ≈ 1（1.31, NS）。\n      原因：Flash 模型在 RLHF 中对 style 维度的 reward shaping 较弱，\n      不会 systematically 偏好某种 style。GEE 中 originality confound\n      显著说明 Gemini 仍能检测到 rewriting artifact（偏好 LLM-polished text），\n      但不会将 style difference 转化为 quality preference。\n      Biased judges 比例降至 2/5，进一步削弱 \"widespread\" 叙事。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Cross-Judge Formality BT Summary\"\n        headers: [Judge, Architecture, BT, CI, p, Biased]\n        rows:\n          - [GPT-4o, \"Proprietary (OpenAI)\", \"63.0%\", \"[55.8, 70.3]\", \"<0.001\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [Qwen3-32B, \"Open (Alibaba)\", \"66.5%\", \"[58.5, 73.9]\", \"<0.0001\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [Claude Sonnet 4, \"Proprietary (Anthropic)\", \"56.2%\", \"[48.9, 63.6]\", \"0.091\", \"No (ctrl)\"]\n          - [Llama-3.3-70B, \"Open (Meta)\", \"52.0%\", \"[44.5, 59.8]\", \"0.55\", \"No\"]\n          - [Gemini-2.0-Flash, \"Proprietary (Google)\", \"55.1%\", \"[47.5, 62.7]\", \"0.17\", \"No\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Forest plot: 5 judges formality BT with 95% CI。GPT-4o/Qwen3-32B CI 不含 50%；Claude/Llama/Gemini CI 含 50%。清晰 2/5 split。\"\n    analysis: >\n      2/5 split 强化 \"CSD as per-judge diagnostic tool\" 定位。\n      No correlation with proprietary vs open → bias 不是 model accessibility artifact。\n\n  - name: \"Multi-benchmark formality pairwise (extended judges)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-002\"\n    description: >\n      扩展 CSD pipeline 到 AlpacaEval + MT-Bench，加入 Llama/Gemini judges。\n      GPT-4o 两个 benchmark 已完成；Qwen3-32B 数据已在 paper_framing 中。\n    expected_results:\n      # New cells: Llama + Gemini on AlpacaEval + MT-Bench\n      llama_alpacaeval_formality_bt: 0.535\n      llama_alpacaeval_formality_p: 0.42\n      llama_mtbench_formality_bt: 0.512\n      llama_mtbench_formality_p: 0.80\n      gemini_alpacaeval_formality_bt: 0.558\n      gemini_alpacaeval_formality_p: 0.16\n      gemini_mtbench_formality_bt: 0.542\n      gemini_mtbench_formality_p: 0.32\n      # Qwen3-32B (from paper_framing, already collected)\n      qwen32b_alpacaeval_bt: 0.657\n      qwen32b_mtbench_bt: 0.712\n      # Cross-benchmark consistency\n      biased_judges_consistent_across_benchmarks: true\n      unbiased_judges_consistent_across_benchmarks: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Cross-benchmark 结果呈现 judge-level consistency：GPT-4o 和 Qwen3-32B\n      在所有 3 个 benchmark 上均 significant（BT 63-73%），而 Llama（51-54%）\n      和 Gemini（54-56%）在所有 benchmark 上均 NS。\n      这实际是有价值的 finding：susceptibility 是 architecture-level 属性，\n      不是 benchmark-specific。Per-axis confound structure（GEE decomposition）\n      在 biased judges 上跨 benchmark 复制（Qwen3-32B AlpacaEval Style OR ≈ 4.5,\n      Orig OR ≈ 3.8），而 unbiased judges GEE Style OR ≈ 1.1-1.3（NS）。\n      Worst case 下 Llama/Gemini 的 cross-benchmark consistency 强化了\n      \"bias is architecture-dependent\" 的 empirical claim。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Cross-Benchmark × Cross-Judge Formality BT Matrix\"\n        headers: [Judge, LLMBar, AlpacaEval, MT-Bench, Consistent]\n        rows:\n          - [GPT-4o, \"63.0%***\", \"72.7%***\", \"69.2%***\", \"Biased ✓\"]\n          - [Qwen3-32B, \"66.5%***\", \"65.7%***\", \"71.2%***\", \"Biased ✓\"]\n          - [Llama-70B, \"52.0% ns\", \"53.5% ns\", \"51.2% ns\", \"Unbiased ✓\"]\n          - [Gemini-Flash, \"55.1% ns\", \"55.8% ns\", \"54.2% ns\", \"Unbiased ✓\"]\n          - [Claude (ctrl), \"56.2% ns\", \"—\", \"—\", \"Unbiased ✓\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Heatmap: judge × benchmark, color = |BT - 50%|。清晰的 row-level clustering（biased vs unbiased），非 column-level（non-benchmark-specific）。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Judge-level consistency 支撑 C3 reframe。在 worst case 下，\n      \"CSD diagnoses architecture-level susceptibility\" 比 \"all judges are biased\" 更精确、更有 practical value。\n\n  - name: \"Likert vs Pairwise sensitivity (incl. 100-point Likert ablation)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-003\"\n    description: >\n      Systematic sensitivity comparison：7-point Likert、100-point Likert、BT pairwise。\n      WORST CASE 核心实验：100-point Likert 检测到 verbosity bias 但不检测 formality。\n    expected_results:\n      # 100-point Likert — verbosity (Qwen3-32B × LLMBar)\n      likert_100pt_verbosity_n: 86\n      likert_100pt_verbosity_ate: 2.84\n      likert_100pt_verbosity_p: 0.008\n      likert_100pt_verbosity_d: 0.31\n      likert_100pt_verbosity_tie_rate: 0.09\n      likert_100pt_verbosity_mean_verbose: 68.2\n      likert_100pt_verbosity_mean_concise: 65.4\n      likert_100pt_verbosity_wilcoxon_p: 0.011\n      # 100-point Likert — formality (Qwen3-32B × LLMBar, n=355)\n      likert_100pt_formality_n: 355\n      likert_100pt_formality_ate: 0.48\n      likert_100pt_formality_p: 0.52\n      likert_100pt_formality_d: 0.04\n      likert_100pt_formality_tie_rate: 0.04\n      likert_100pt_formality_mean_formal: 66.9\n      likert_100pt_formality_mean_casual: 66.4\n      # 100-point Likert — verbosity (GPT-4o × LLMBar)\n      likert_100pt_gpt4o_verbosity_n: 86\n      likert_100pt_gpt4o_verbosity_d: 0.27\n      likert_100pt_gpt4o_verbosity_p: 0.018\n      # 100-point Likert — formality (GPT-4o × LLMBar)\n      likert_100pt_gpt4o_formality_d: 0.06\n      likert_100pt_gpt4o_formality_p: 0.38\n      # Attenuation ratios\n      attenuation_7pt_formality: \">17×\"\n      attenuation_7pt_verbosity: \">10×\"\n      attenuation_100pt_formality: \"~17×\"\n      attenuation_100pt_verbosity: \"~4×\"\n      # Threshold\n      blindspot_threshold_bt_approx: 0.75\n      note: \"Axes with BT > ~75% partially detectable by 100-point Likert; BT 60-70% universally blind\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      100-point Likert 在 verbosity 上检测到 d=0.31（p=0.008），原因：\n      (1) Verbosity BT = 77.3% 是所有 axis 中最强的效应，对应 d_BT_equiv ≈ 1.2；\n      (2) 100-point scale 将 tie rate 从 7-point 的 58% 降至 9%，\n      释放了大量被 ceiling/floor compression 锁死的 variance；\n      (3) d=0.31 虽然 significant 但仍远低于 BT equivalent（ratio 4×），\n      说明 Likert 仍 severely attenuates 即使使用 fine-grained scale。\n      \n      Formality 100-point Likert 仍 NS（d=0.04, p=0.52），原因：\n      (1) Formality BT = 66.5% 是 moderate effect，d_BT_equiv ≈ 0.7；\n      (2) 即使 tie rate 降至 4%，underlying effect 太弱（d=0.04），\n      即使在 n=355 上也无法达到显著性（power at d=0.04 n=355 α=0.05 ≈ 8%）；\n      (3) Formality 的 GEE 显示 Style + Orig 均显著 → conditional effect，\n      在绝对评分中 style 和 originality 的相反方向效应可能互相抵消。\n      \n      核心含义：Blindspot 是 effect-size-dependent。Strong effects（BT>75%）\n      可被 fine-grained Likert 部分检测（但仍严重衰减 4×），\n      moderate effects（BT 60-70%）在任何 Likert scale 上都不可见。\n      这比 \"Likert always misses\" 更 nuanced，学术价值更高。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Measurement Mode × Scale × Axis Sensitivity Matrix (Qwen3-32B × LLMBar)\"\n        headers: [Method, Formality d, Formality p, Verbosity d, Verbosity p, Detects]\n        rows:\n          - [\"7-pt Likert ATE\", \"0.012\", \"0.908\", \"-0.146\", \"0.179\", \"Neither\"]\n          - [\"7-pt Ordinal LR\", \"-0.079\", \"0.769\", \"0.159\", \"0.575\", \"Neither\"]\n          - [\"7-pt Mann-Whitney\", \"—\", \"0.905\", \"—\", \"0.578\", \"Neither\"]\n          - [\"7-pt Binarized χ²\", \"—\", \"0.296\", \"—\", \"0.213\", \"Neither\"]\n          - [\"7-pt Cohen's d\", \"0.012\", \">0.2\", \"0.036\", \">0.2\", \"Neither\"]\n          - [\"7-pt Likert (all 6)\", \"0/6 sig\", \"—\", \"0/6 sig\", \"—\", \"0/12\"]\n          - [\"100-pt Likert ATE\", \"0.04\", \"0.52\", \"0.31\", \"0.008\", \"Verbosity only\"]\n          - [\"BT pairwise\", \"66.5%\", \"<0.0001\", \"77.3%\", \"<0.0001\", \"Both\"]\n      - title: \"Attenuation Ratio by Scale × Axis\"\n        headers: [Scale, Formality ratio, Verbosity ratio, Interpretation]\n        rows:\n          - [\"7-point\", \">17×\", \">10×\", \"Universal blindspot\"]\n          - [\"100-point\", \"~17×\", \"~4×\", \"Partial rescue for strong effects only\"]\n          - [\"Implication\", \"Scale irrelevant\", \"Scale helps but still 4× loss\", \"Effect-size-dependent\"]\n      - title: \"100-point Likert Detection Threshold Analysis\"\n        headers: [Axis, BT, 7-pt d, 100-pt d, 100-pt p, Detected]\n        rows:\n          - [Register, \"55.3%\", \"0.069\", \"0.05\", \"0.65\", \"No\"]\n          - [Formality, \"66.5%\", \"0.012\", \"0.04\", \"0.52\", \"No\"]\n          - [Verbosity, \"77.3%\", \"-0.146\", \"0.31\", \"0.008\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [Threshold, \"~75%\", \"—\", \"~0.25\", \"<0.05\", \"BT > 75%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter: x = BT effect size (%), y = Likert Cohen's d, 按 scale type 分色（7-pt grey, 100-pt blue）。7-point 全在 d≈0 水平线；100-point formality/register 仍在 0 附近，verbosity 跳至 d=0.31。BT reference diagonal 显示 massive gap。Annotated threshold at BT≈75%。\"\n      - \"Bar chart: tie rate comparison。7-pt verbosity 58% → 100-pt verbosity 9%；7-pt formality 73% → 100-pt formality 4%。Granularity 释放 variance 但不足以检测 moderate effects。\"\n      - \"Power curve: d=0.04（formality 100-pt）vs d=0.31（verbosity 100-pt）at various n。d=0.04 需 n>4000 才能达 80% power；d=0.31 在 n=86 达 ~75% power。\"\n    analysis: >\n      100-point Likert verbosity significant 是 worst case 的 defining challenge。\n      Reframe 策略：(1) \"effect-size-dependent measurement sensitivity\" 比 \"Likert always fails\" 更 nuanced；\n      (2) 即使 100-pt 检测到 verbosity，attenuation ratio 仍 4× — pairwise 仍远优于 Likert；\n      (3) Formality（medium effect）在 n=355 × 100-point 仍 NS → 实际场景中多数 bias 不可被 Likert 检测；\n      (4) Per-axis confound structure（C2b）解释了为什么不同 axis 有不同检测阈值：\n      verbosity 是 pure style（无 originality confound 抵消），formality 是 conditional\n      （style + originality 在 absolute scoring 中方向可能相反，互相抵消）。\n\n  - name: \"Pairwise RATE control (all judge × benchmark)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-005\"\n    description: >\n      原始 vs double-rewrite placebo 扩展到所有 judge × benchmark combinations。\n      GPT-4o 和 Qwen3-32B × LLMBar 已完成。\n    expected_results:\n      # Already done (from registry)\n      qwen32b_lmbar_formality_p_orig: 0.377\n      qwen32b_lmbar_verbosity_p_orig: 0.082\n      gpt4o_lmbar_formality_p_orig: 0.418\n      gpt4o_lmbar_verbosity_p_orig: 0.167\n      # New: Llama × LLMBar\n      llama_lmbar_formality_p_orig: 0.425\n      llama_lmbar_formality_p: 0.065\n      llama_lmbar_verbosity_p_orig: 0.215\n      llama_lmbar_verbosity_p: \"<0.0001\"\n      # New: Gemini × LLMBar\n      gemini_lmbar_formality_p_orig: 0.438\n      gemini_lmbar_formality_p: 0.11\n      # New: GPT-4o × AlpacaEval\n      gpt4o_alpacaeval_formality_p_orig: 0.395\n      gpt4o_alpacaeval_formality_p: 0.008\n      # Cross-judge artifact\n      artifact_direction: \"ALL judges prefer DR over original (universal)\"\n      artifact_magnitude_order: \"Verbosity >> Formality across all judges\"\n      artifact_vs_style_independence: \"Llama has artifact (P(orig)=42-22%) but NO style bias → artifact ≠ style bias\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Rewriting artifact 是 universal 现象——所有 judge 均偏好 LLM-polished (DR) text，\n      与 judge 是否展现 style bias 无关。\n      关键 worst-case 证据：Llama 有 artifact（formality P(orig)=42.5%, verbosity P(orig)=21.5%）\n      但 style bias BT 均 NS（52-54%）。\n      这证明 (1) artifact 和 style bias 是独立维度；\n      (2) GEE decomposition 正确分离了二者（verbosity Orig OR NS = style clean）；\n      (3) unbiased judges 的 artifact 不会 escalate 为 style bias。\n      AlpacaEval 的 artifact 略强于 LLMBar（P(orig)=39.5% vs 41.8%），\n      可能因 AlpacaEval instructions 更 open-ended，rewriting polishing 更明显。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Placebo P(original) Across Judges × Benchmarks\"\n        headers: [Judge, LLMBar Form, LLMBar Verb, AlpacaEval Form, Style biased?]\n        rows:\n          - [GPT-4o, \"0.418*\", \"0.167***\", \"0.395**\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [Qwen3-32B, \"0.377***\", \"0.082***\", \"—\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [Llama-70B, \"0.425 ns\", \"0.215***\", \"—\", \"No\"]\n          - [Gemini-Flash, \"0.438 ns\", \"—\", \"—\", \"No\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter: x = placebo P(original), y = style BT。Biased judges (GPT-4o, Qwen3-32B) 在右上；Llama 在左下（low P(orig) but low BT）。No correlation → artifact ≠ style bias。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Llama 有 artifact 但无 bias 是 worst case 下的 silver lining。\n      它直接反驳 \"pairwise format creates bias from artifact\" 假说：\n      如果 artifact sufficient for bias，Llama 应该也 biased — 但它不是。\n\n  - name: \"Scaled replication (n=400, Qwen3-32B formality)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-006\"\n    description: >\n      n=100 → n=400 scaled replication。已在 registry 中完成（exp-006）。\n      展示 worst case 下此数据如何被引用。\n    expected_results:\n      n_total: 400\n      nli_pass: 355\n      nli_rate: 0.888\n      bt_p_formal: 0.675\n      bt_ci: [0.637, 0.713]\n      bt_ci_width_pp: 7.6\n      bt_p_value: 0.0001\n      likert_7pt_ate: -0.059\n      likert_7pt_p: 0.60\n      likert_7pt_d: -0.025\n      likert_7pt_tie_rate: 0.434\n      gee_style_or: 2.15\n      gee_style_ci: [1.46, 3.16]\n      gee_orig_or: 4.99\n      gee_orig_ci: [3.40, 7.34]\n      vs_n100_bt_delta_pp: \"+1.0\"\n      vs_n100_ci_narrowing: \"2× (15.4pp → 7.6pp)\"\n      bootstrap_attenuation_d_median: -0.017\n      bootstrap_attenuation_flat: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      已完成实验，结果与 worst case 完全一致。n=355 确认：\n      (1) BT 67.5% 稳定（vs n=100 的 66.5%，Δ=+1.0pp within CI）；\n      (2) 7-point Likert d=-0.025 在 n=355 仍 NS → 不是 power 问题；\n      (3) Bootstrap attenuation curve 是 smoking gun：d_median flat at -0.017\n      across n=50→355，CI 始终含 0 → definitive measurement attenuation 证据；\n      (4) GEE Style OR=2.15（moderate）确认 formality 是 conditional effect\n      （vs verbosity Style OR=13.1 pure effect）。\n      在 worst case 下，formality Blindspot 在 7-point 和 100-point Likert 上均成立，\n      是论文最 robust 的单一 evidence piece。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Scaled Replication: n=100 vs n=355 Comparison\"\n        headers: [Metric, \"n=100\", \"n=355\", Delta]\n        rows:\n          - [BT, \"66.5%\", \"67.5%\", \"+1.0pp\"]\n          - [BT CI width, \"15.4pp\", \"7.6pp\", \"2× narrower\"]\n          - [Likert d, \"0.012\", \"-0.025\", \"~0 (stable)\"]\n          - [GEE Style OR, \"4.20\", \"2.15\", \"Regression to true effect\"]\n          - [GEE Orig OR, \"4.70\", \"4.99\", \"Stable\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Bootstrap attenuation curve（已生成）：d_median vs n (50→355)，flat at -0.017。已在 registry 中。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Formality × Qwen3-32B (n=355) 是论文的 anchor result，worst case 不改变此数据。\n      与 100-point Likert formality NS（exp-003）形成 converging evidence：\n      无论 7-point 还是 100-point，无论 n=100 还是 n=355，\n      formality Likert Blindspot 都成立。\n\n  - name: \"Non-Qwen rewriter control (Llama-3.1-70B rewriter)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-009\"\n    description: >\n      Llama-3.1-70B-Instruct 作为 alternative rewriter，排除 Qwen-family artifact。\n      与已完成的 GPT-4o rewriter (64.4%) 和 Qwen3-32B rewriter (66.5%) 对比。\n    expected_results:\n      llama_rewriter_n_generated: 100\n      llama_rewriter_nli_pass: 87\n      llama_rewriter_nli_rate: 0.87\n      llama_rewriter_nli_mean: 0.882\n      llama_rewriter_bt_formality: 0.641\n      llama_rewriter_bt_ci: [0.558, 0.724]\n      llama_rewriter_bt_p: 0.0008\n      llama_rewriter_likert_d: -0.035\n      llama_rewriter_likert_p: 0.71\n      llama_rewriter_gee_style_or: 3.65\n      llama_rewriter_gee_style_p: 0.001\n      llama_rewriter_gee_orig_or: 5.80\n      llama_rewriter_gee_orig_p: 0.0001\n      three_rewriter_range_pp: 2.4\n      three_rewriter_ci_overlap: true\n      rewriter_independence_confirmed: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      三个独立 rewriter family（Qwen3-32B 66.5%, GPT-4o 64.4%, Llama-70B 64.1%）\n      产生的 BT 在 2.4pp 范围内，所有 CI 重叠且均排除 50%。\n      NLI pass rate 三者类似（88%/90%/87%），说明 counterfactual quality 与 rewriter 无关。\n      Llama rewriter 的 GEE pattern 也复制：Style + Orig 均显著（conditional effect）。\n      Worst case 下此实验不受影响——rewriter independence 是 method validation，\n      与 judge-level results（Llama-as-judge 无 bias）完全正交。\n      三个 rewriter 的 convergence 证明 CSD 不是 Qwen3-32B 特定 artifact。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Three-Rewriter Formality BT Comparison (Qwen3-32B judge × LLMBar)\"\n        headers: [Rewriter, NLI pass, BT, CI, p, Δ vs Qwen-rewriter]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen3-32B, \"88%\", \"66.5%\", \"[58.5, 73.9]\", \"<0.0001\", \"baseline\"]\n          - [GPT-4o, \"90%\", \"64.4%\", \"[56.1, 72.8]\", \"0.0006\", \"-2.1pp\"]\n          - [Llama-3.1-70B, \"87%\", \"64.1%\", \"[55.8, 72.4]\", \"0.0008\", \"-2.4pp\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Forest plot: 3 rewriters BT with CI。三者 CI 重叠且不含 50%。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Rewriter independence 在 worst case 下是 net positive：\n      证明 detected style bias 不依赖特定 rewriter model，是 CSD 方法 robustness 的关键 validation。\n\n  - name: \"GPT-4o verbosity + register Likert scoring\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-020\"\n    description: >\n      GPT-4o Likert ATE 分析。Pairwise 和 GEE 已完成（registry）。\n      Verbosity Likert ATE 是 Blindspot evidence matrix 的关键缺失格。\n    expected_results:\n      # Verbosity (pairwise/GEE from registry; Likert from registry)\n      gpt4o_verbosity_bt: 0.760\n      gpt4o_verbosity_likert_ate: 0.116\n      gpt4o_verbosity_likert_p: 0.403\n      gpt4o_verbosity_likert_d: 0.078\n      gpt4o_verbosity_likert_tie_rate: 0.581\n      gpt4o_verbosity_gee_style_or: 10.97\n      gpt4o_verbosity_gee_orig_or: 0.44\n      gpt4o_verbosity_blindspot: true\n      # Register (from registry)\n      gpt4o_register_bt: 0.570\n      gpt4o_register_likert_ate: 0.0\n      gpt4o_register_likert_p: 0.785\n      gpt4o_register_likert_d: 0.0\n      gpt4o_register_gee_style_or: 1.88\n      gpt4o_register_gee_orig_or: 2.21\n      gpt4o_register_blindspot: true\n      # 100-point Likert extension (worst case)\n      gpt4o_100pt_verbosity_d: 0.27\n      gpt4o_100pt_verbosity_p: 0.018\n      gpt4o_100pt_formality_d: 0.06\n      gpt4o_100pt_formality_p: 0.38\n    result_rationale: >\n      GPT-4o 在所有 3 个 axis 上均展现 7-point Likert Blindspot\n      （BT significant, Likert NS）。Verbosity ATE=0.116 (p=0.40) 确认\n      BT 76.0% 的 bias 被 Likert 完全遗漏。\n      在 worst case 下，100-point Likert 对 GPT-4o verbosity 也检测到 d=0.27（p=0.018），\n      与 Qwen3-32B pattern 一致（both BT >75%, both 100-pt detectable）。\n      GPT-4o formality 100-point d=0.06（NS），同样与 Qwen3-32B 一致。\n      这确认了 effect-size threshold 是 cross-judge 的，不是 judge-specific 的。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"GPT-4o Full Blindspot Matrix\"\n        headers: [Axis, BT, BT p, 7-pt d, 7-pt p, 100-pt d, 100-pt p, Blindspot]\n        rows:\n          - [Formality, \"63.0%\", \"<0.001\", \"-0.069\", \"0.332\", \"0.06\", \"0.38\", \"Yes (all scales)\"]\n          - [Verbosity, \"76.0%\", \"0.0001\", \"0.078\", \"0.403\", \"0.27\", \"0.018\", \"7-pt only\"]\n          - [Register, \"57.0%\", \"0.04\", \"0.0\", \"0.785\", \"—\", \"—\", \"Yes (all scales)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"GPT-4o 3-axis panel: BT vs 7-pt Likert vs 100-pt Likert bar chart。Verbosity 100-pt bar crosses significance threshold；其余均 NS。\"\n    analysis: >\n      GPT-4o 100-point verbosity significant 进一步确认 threshold 是 ~BT>75%。\n      两个 biased judges（GPT-4o + Qwen3-32B）均展现相同 threshold pattern → \n      effect-size-dependent sensitivity 是 robust cross-judge finding。\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct third target judge\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-021\"\n    description: >\n      Llama-3.3-70B as third target judge：formality + verbosity on LLMBar。\n      WORST CASE DEFINING EXPERIMENT：Llama 两轴均 NS，类似 Claude。\n    expected_results:\n      # Formality\n      llama_formality_n_pairs: 88\n      llama_formality_n_comparisons: 176\n      llama_formality_consistency_rate: 0.57\n      llama_formality_bt_p_formal: 0.520\n      llama_formality_bt_ci: [0.445, 0.598]\n      llama_formality_bt_p_value: 0.55\n      llama_formality_likert_ate: -0.023\n      llama_formality_likert_p: 0.82\n      llama_formality_likert_d: -0.018\n      llama_formality_likert_tie_rate: 0.69\n      llama_formality_gee_style_or: 1.12\n      llama_formality_gee_style_ci: [0.55, 2.28]\n      llama_formality_gee_style_p: 0.75\n      llama_formality_gee_orig_or: 5.45\n      llama_formality_gee_orig_ci: [2.56, 11.60]\n      llama_formality_gee_orig_p: 0.0001\n      llama_formality_dir_f2c_win: 0.548\n      llama_formality_dir_f2c_p: 0.65\n      llama_formality_dir_c2f_win: 0.488\n      llama_formality_dir_c2f_p: 0.92\n      # Verbosity\n      llama_verbosity_n_pairs: 86\n      llama_verbosity_n_comparisons: 172\n      llama_verbosity_consistency_rate: 0.55\n      llama_verbosity_bt_p_verbose: 0.538\n      llama_verbosity_bt_ci: [0.462, 0.614]\n      llama_verbosity_bt_p_value: 0.35\n      llama_verbosity_likert_ate: 0.035\n      llama_verbosity_likert_p: 0.76\n      llama_verbosity_likert_d: 0.028\n      llama_verbosity_likert_tie_rate: 0.67\n      llama_verbosity_gee_style_or: 1.28\n      llama_verbosity_gee_style_ci: [0.58, 2.82]\n      llama_verbosity_gee_style_p: 0.52\n      llama_verbosity_gee_orig_or: 0.82\n      llama_verbosity_gee_orig_ci: [0.38, 1.78]\n      llama_verbosity_gee_orig_p: 0.58\n      llama_verbosity_dir_v2c_win: 0.52\n      llama_verbosity_dir_v2c_p: 0.78\n      llama_verbosity_dir_c2v_win: 0.55\n      llama_verbosity_dir_c2v_p: 0.48\n      # TOST equivalence\n      llama_tost_formality_margin: 0.15\n      llama_tost_formality_p_upper: 0.001\n      llama_tost_formality_confirmed: true\n      llama_tost_formality_90ci: [0.455, 0.585]\n      llama_tost_verbosity_margin: 0.15\n      llama_tost_verbosity_p_upper: 0.003\n      llama_tost_verbosity_confirmed: true\n      llama_tost_verbosity_90ci: [0.473, 0.603]\n      # 7-method sensitivity (verbosity)\n      llama_verbosity_7method_all_ns: true\n      llama_verbosity_bt_also_ns: true\n      # Summary\n      llama_biased: false\n      llama_pattern: \"Matches Claude — no style sensitivity on either axis\"\n      n_biased_target_judges: 2\n      n_total_judges: 4\n      biased_ratio: \"2/4 (GPT-4o + Qwen3-32B)\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Llama-3.3-70B 两轴均 NS 是 worst case 的核心事件。\n\n      Formality：BT 52.0%（CI 含 50%，p=0.55），GEE Style OR=1.12（NS）。\n      与 Claude（BT 56.2%，Style OR=1.47）pattern 高度一致——两者都仅检测到\n      originality confound（Orig OR 5.45/6.66）但无 style effect。\n      这说明 Meta 和 Anthropic 的 alignment 流程都产生了 style-neutral 的 judge behavior。\n      \n      Verbosity：BT 53.8%（p=0.35），GEE Style OR=1.28（NS），Orig OR=0.82（NS）。\n      与 Claude（BT 54.1%，Style OR=1.52）一致。值得注意的是 Llama verbosity \n      Orig OR=0.82（NS），而 Claude Orig OR=0.80（NS），两者在 verbosity 上\n      都不展现 originality confound——与 biased judges（GPT-4o/Qwen3-32B）的\n      Orig OR=0.44-0.49 方向一致但 magnitude 不同。\n      \n      TOST equivalence 在 Δ=0.15 下两轴均通过（formality p=0.001, verbosity p=0.003），\n      确认 null 是 genuine absence 而非 underpowered。注意：Claude 在 Δ=0.10 下\n      TOST 失败（formality p=0.155），但 Llama point estimates 更接近 50%，\n      即使在 Δ=0.10 下也可能通过（formality p≈0.05, borderline）。\n      \n      对论文影响：\n      (1) \"3 independent architectures confirm bias\" → 变为 \"CSD discriminates: 2/4 biased, 2/4 unbiased\"\n      (2) MF1 Layer 5 不再是 anti-amplification 证据，但可 reframe 为\n      \"same pairwise format, same counterfactuals, no bias → format doesn't create bias\"\n      (3) 50/50 split 实际更有 practical value：不是所有 judge 都 biased，\n      practitioners 需要 CSD 进行 per-judge 审计来确定哪些 judge 可信。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Llama-70B vs Claude Sonnet 4 (Negative Controls)\"\n        headers: [Metric, Llama Form, Llama Verb, Claude Form, Claude Verb]\n        rows:\n          - [BT, \"52.0%\", \"53.8%\", \"56.2%\", \"54.1%\"]\n          - [BT p, \"0.55\", \"0.35\", \"0.091\", \"0.284\"]\n          - [BT CI, \"[44.5, 59.8]\", \"[46.2, 61.4]\", \"[48.9, 63.6]\", \"[45.9, 61.6]\"]\n          - [Likert d, \"-0.018\", \"0.028\", \"-0.021\", \"-0.039\"]\n          - [GEE Style OR, \"1.12 ns\", \"1.28 ns\", \"1.47 ns\", \"1.52 ns\"]\n          - [GEE Orig OR, \"5.45***\", \"0.82 ns\", \"6.66***\", \"0.80 ns\"]\n          - [TOST Δ=0.15, \"✓ p=.001\", \"✓ p=.003\", \"✓ p=.009\", \"✓ p=.016\"]\n      - title: \"Judge Susceptibility Matrix (Worst Case Final)\"\n        headers: [Judge, Formality BT, Verbosity BT, Style OR range, Biased]\n        rows:\n          - [GPT-4o, \"63.0%***\", \"76.0%***\", \"2.21–10.97\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [Qwen3-32B, \"66.5%***\", \"77.3%***\", \"4.20–13.10\", \"Yes\"]\n          - [Llama-70B, \"52.0% ns\", \"53.8% ns\", \"1.12–1.28\", \"No\"]\n          - [Claude (ctrl), \"56.2% ns\", \"54.1% ns\", \"1.47–1.52\", \"No\"]\n      - title: \"Llama GEE Decomposition (Per-Axis)\"\n        headers: [Axis, Style OR, Style p, Orig OR, Orig p, Regime]\n        rows:\n          - [Formality, \"1.12\", \"0.75\", \"5.45\", \"<0.0001\", \"Originality-only\"]\n          - [Verbosity, \"1.28\", \"0.52\", \"0.82\", \"0.58\", \"Null (no effect)\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"2×2 Judge susceptibility heatmap：行 = judge，列 = axis。Color = BT deviation from 50%。GPT-4o/Qwen3-32B 行全红（13-27pp deviation）；Llama/Claude 行全灰（2-6pp deviation）。\"\n      - \"Forest plot: 4 judges × 2 axes (8 entries) BT with CI。清晰的 bimodal distribution：4 个 CI 不含 50%（biased），4 个 CI 含 50%（unbiased）。\"\n      - \"GEE Style OR forest plot: 4 judges × 2 axes。GPT-4o/Qwen3-32B OR 远离 1（2.2-13.1）；Llama/Claude OR 接近 1（1.1-1.5），所有 CI 含 1。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Llama 无 bias 将论文从 \"most judges are biased\" reframe 为\n      \"some architectures are susceptible, CSD identifies which\"。\n      2/4 split 的 practical implication：\n      在 alignment pipeline 中，使用 Llama/Claude 作为 judge 不受 style bias 影响，\n      而 GPT-4o/Qwen3-32B 需要 CSD 审计和 per-axis decomposition 来解读结果。\n      这比 \"all judges are biased, avoid Likert\" 更 actionable。\n\n  - name: \"Double-rewrite placebo BT (anti-amplification)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-022\"\n    description: >\n      Original vs double-rewrite pairwise comparison。已在 registry 完成（GPT-4o + Qwen3-32B）。\n      Worst case 增加 Llama placebo。\n    expected_results:\n      # Registry data (unchanged)\n      qwen32b_formality_p_orig: 0.377\n      qwen32b_formality_p: 0.0006\n      qwen32b_verbosity_p_orig: 0.082\n      qwen32b_verbosity_p: 0.0\n      gpt4o_formality_p_orig: 0.418\n      gpt4o_formality_p: 0.037\n      gpt4o_verbosity_p_orig: 0.167\n      gpt4o_verbosity_p: 0.0\n      # Worst case: Llama placebo\n      llama_formality_p_orig: 0.428\n      llama_formality_p: 0.07\n      llama_verbosity_p_orig: 0.230\n      llama_verbosity_p: 0.0001\n      # Key insight\n      artifact_present_in_all: true\n      style_bias_present_only_in_gpt4o_qwen32b: true\n      artifact_style_independence: \"Llama has artifact but no style bias → artifact ≠ sufficient for style bias\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      所有 judge（包括 unbiased 的 Llama）都偏好 DR over original：\n      Llama formality P(orig)=42.8%（borderline, p=0.07），verbosity P(orig)=23.0%（p<0.0001）。\n      但 Llama style bias BT = 52-54%（NS）。\n      这是 worst case 下最强的 anti-amplification 证据之一：\n      如果 pairwise format + rewriting artifact sufficient for style bias detection，\n      Llama 应该也展现 style bias——但它没有。\n      推论：style bias 是 judge architecture 的内在属性，不是 pairwise format 的 artifact。\n      GEE decomposition 正确分离了 artifact（Orig OR）和 style（Style OR）。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Placebo vs Style Bias: Independence Evidence\"\n        headers: [Judge, Form P(orig), Verb P(orig), Form style BT, Verb style BT, Conclusion]\n        rows:\n          - [GPT-4o, \"41.8%*\", \"16.7%***\", \"63.0%***\", \"76.0%***\", \"Artifact + Bias\"]\n          - [Qwen3-32B, \"37.7%***\", \"8.2%***\", \"66.5%***\", \"77.3%***\", \"Artifact + Bias\"]\n          - [Llama-70B, \"42.8% ns\", \"23.0%***\", \"52.0% ns\", \"53.8% ns\", \"Artifact only, NO Bias\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Scatter: x = artifact magnitude (1 - P(orig)), y = style BT。Llama 在右下象限（strong artifact, no bias）→ 反驳 artifact→bias 因果链。\"\n    analysis: >\n      Llama 的 \"artifact without bias\" pattern 是 worst case 下\n      最有力的 detection-not-amplification 论证。\n      MF1 defense 从 5 层减为 4 层，但这 1 个 observation 的说服力不弱于原本的 Layer 5。\n\n  - name: \"NLI gate ablation (NLI-pass vs NLI-fail BT)\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-023\"\n    description: >\n      BT on NLI-pass vs NLI-fail 子集。已在 registry 完成（nli_gate_ablation）。\n      Worst case 增加 Llama NLI ablation。\n    expected_results:\n      # Registry data (unchanged)\n      qwen_formality_nli_pass_bt: 0.665\n      qwen_formality_nli_fail_bt: 0.417\n      qwen_formality_nli_fail_note: \"REVERSED — prefer casual\"\n      qwen_verbosity_nli_pass_bt: 0.773\n      qwen_verbosity_nli_fail_bt: 0.750\n      qwen_verbosity_nli_fail_note: \"Stable — too strong for gate to affect\"\n      # Worst case: Llama NLI ablation\n      llama_formality_nli_pass_bt: 0.520\n      llama_formality_nli_fail_bt: 0.46\n      llama_formality_nli_fail_n: 12\n      llama_verbosity_nli_pass_bt: 0.538\n      llama_verbosity_nli_fail_bt: 0.50\n      llama_verbosity_nli_fail_n: 14\n    result_rationale: >\n      NLI ablation 是 MF1 Layer 1，在 worst case 下保持完整。\n      Qwen3-32B formality NLI-fail BT 41.7%（反转偏好 casual）是核心证据：\n      如果 pairwise 放大 bias，移除 NLI gate 应进一步放大——但相反，它反转了。\n      说明 NLI gate cleans content noise，不是 amplifies style signal。\n      \n      Llama NLI ablation（worst case extension）：两轴 NLI-fail BT 接近 50%\n      （formality 46%, verbosity 50%），与 overall null result 一致。\n      Llama 在 NLI-pass 和 NLI-fail 上都不展现 style sensitivity，\n      进一步确认 Llama 是 genuinely style-neutral judge。\n      NLI-fail n 小（12-14），结果仅作为 bounds 报告。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"NLI Ablation: Pass vs Fail BT\"\n        headers: [Judge, Axis, NLI-pass BT, NLI-fail BT, n_fail, Interpretation]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen3-32B, Formality, \"66.5%***\", \"41.7% ns\", 12, \"Reversal → gate cleans\"]\n          - [Qwen3-32B, Verbosity, \"77.3%***\", \"75.0%**\", 14, \"Too strong for gate\"]\n          - [Llama-70B, Formality, \"52.0% ns\", \"46% ns\", 12, \"No sensitivity either way\"]\n          - [Llama-70B, Verbosity, \"53.8% ns\", \"50% ns\", 14, \"No sensitivity either way\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Paired bar chart: NLI-pass vs NLI-fail per judge × axis。Qwen3-32B formality 反转是 visual highlight。Llama 两组均接近 50%。\"\n    analysis: >\n      MF1 Layer 1 在 worst case 下保持。NLI ablation reversal 仍是\n      最强 anti-amplification 单一 evidence。\n      Llama 的 flat response（pass ≈ fail ≈ 50%）是 complementary evidence。\n\n  - name: \"Cross-axis gradient formalization\"\n    plan_id: \"exp-024\"\n    description: >\n      NLI rejection rate vs BT for 3 axes。已在 registry 完成（cross_axis_gradient）。\n      Qualitative argument，3 points only。\n    expected_results:\n      register_nli_rejection: 0.06\n      register_bt_qwen: 0.553\n      register_gee_style_or: 1.91\n      formality_nli_rejection: 0.12\n      formality_bt_qwen: 0.665\n      formality_gee_style_or: 4.20\n      verbosity_nli_rejection: 0.14\n      verbosity_bt_qwen: 0.773\n      verbosity_gee_style_or: 13.10\n      correlation_direction: positive\n      n_data_points: 3\n      statistical_test: \"N/A — qualitative, 3 points insufficient for regression\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      Cross-axis gradient 已完成。NLI rejection rate（manipulation invasiveness proxy）\n      与 BT 和 GEE Style OR 正相关：\n      Register（6% rejection, BT 55%, OR 1.9）< Formality（12%, 67%, 4.2）< Verbosity（14%, 77%, 13.1）。\n      \n      Anti-amplification 论证：如果 pairwise 统一放大 bias，所有 axis 应有相似 BT\n      （manipulation 程度差异不应影响 amplification）。但 per-axis variation 大（55-77%），\n      且与 manipulation invasiveness 正相关 → 检测到的是真实 bias，不是 format artifact。\n      \n      局限：仅 3 个数据点，不能做 statistical test。在 worst case 下降为 §5.2\n      discussion 中的 qualitative supporting argument（2-3 句话）。\n    tables:\n      - title: \"Cross-Axis Gradient (Qwen3-32B × LLMBar)\"\n        headers: [Axis, NLI reject%, BT, GEE Style OR, 100-pt Likert d]\n        rows:\n          - [Register, \"6%\", \"55.3%\", \"1.91\", \"~0.05 ns\"]\n          - [Formality, \"12%\", \"66.5%\", \"4.20\", \"0.04 ns\"]\n          - [Verbosity, \"14%\", \"77.3%\", \"13.10\", \"0.31*\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Three-point scatter: x = NLI rejection rate, y = BT (left panel) / GEE Style OR (right panel)。Positive trend。Labeled points。\"\n    analysis: >\n      MF1 Layer 2 的 qualitative component。在 worst case 下，\n      cross-axis gradient 与 100-point Likert threshold 形成 converging evidence：\n      manipulation invasiveness → BT effect size → Likert detectability 的梯度一致，\n      支持 \"detection\" 而非 \"amplification\" interpretation。\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"d95a5f3b-8263-4a89-8f8c-68eaf58d3698","total_cost_usd":1.18282525,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":34163,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":37366,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":34163,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":37366,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":34163,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":34163},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":29121,"outputTokens":21,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.029226000000000002,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":37366,"cacheReadInputTokens":11841,"cacheCreationInputTokens":34163,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":1.15359925,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"d2199a53-345e-42d3-978e-c007165da0cb"}
